{"unit_id":"nico-zhuang__dsh-chat-file-actions#card-zh","repo":"nico-zhuang/dsh-chat-file-actions","commit":"18e885d5f051d7045f3b6b79b8858c887fcec585","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat File Actions 是面向 DSH 网页端的对话资源插件，会在已完成回复的操作栏加入「本轮资源」入口。它从当前轮次提问、回复和成功的文件编辑结果中整理明确引用的本地文件及 Markdown 网页链接。用户可查看文件、请求 Host 打开或定位文件、在侧栏预览，并复制路径、文件名或 Markdown 链接；网页链接可在浏览器打开或复制。适合需要集中处理对话文件和链接的 DSH 网页用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:200-240","lib/client.js:919-940"]}
{"unit_id":"nico-zhuang__dsh-chat-file-actions#card-en","repo":"nico-zhuang/dsh-chat-file-actions","commit":"18e885d5f051d7045f3b6b79b8858c887fcec585","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Chat File Actions adds a resource entry below completed replies in DSH web. It collects files and Markdown links mentioned in the current turn, plus successful edit/write results. Users can open or reveal files through DSH Host, preview them in the sidebar, and copy paths or links.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:200-240","lib/client.js:919-940"]}
